<title>USA: Firstar Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Firstar Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							  March 31</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p> Net Income		     $     71,795,000  $    37,118,000</p>
<p> Net Income per share			 0.49		 0.25</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	146,700,853	147,595,716</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q1 net after $0.21 a share restructuring charge. Q1 1996 operating earnings were $0.46 a share.</p>
<p>Assets $19.54 billion vs $19.12 bilion</p>
<p>Deposits $14.59 billion vs $14.13 billion</p>
<p>Net loans $13.13 billion vs $12.62 billion</p>
